        "She says it with the dry composure of a woman who has repeated it many times in front of a mirror. Behind her, on the plinth, the book lies open at a page that is beautifully clean. Bao stands at the back with his broom held across his body, like a man at a doorway. The ninety do not move.",
        "They look at you. If you stand with them, Xu Lan will mark you in the Ledger, and the Ceremony will not be yours. If you do not, they stand before an empty desk with ninety baskets, and a sweeper with a log, and the page does not come back. The dome above them is perfectly silent, and perfectly black.",
